WEBVTT

1.1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.740
Step 1. Open the consent details.

1.2
00:00:02.740 --> 00:00:06.588
You can change the status or the note of a consent.

1.3
00:00:06.588 --> 00:00:11.417
In All Encounters, select View Encounter, then the Consents tab,

1.4
00:00:11.417 --> 00:00:14.030
and See Details on its card.

2.1
00:00:14.030 --> 00:00:19.614
Step 2. Open the edit form. Select Edit beside Consent Details.

2.2
00:00:19.614 --> 00:00:23.162
The form shows only Status and Note.

3.1
00:00:23.162 --> 00:00:26.368
Step 3. Change the status or the note.

3.2
00:00:26.368 --> 00:00:31.503
In Status, you can select any status, whatever the current one is.

3.3
00:00:31.503 --> 00:00:34.959
Then enter or change the text in Note.

4.1
00:00:34.959 --> 00:00:38.075
Step 4. Save the changes. Select Save.

4.2
00:00:38.075 --> 00:00:41.847
Care saves at once, without asking you to confirm,

4.3
00:00:41.847 --> 00:00:46.118
and the Consent Details card shows the new status.
